      "extract": "Chern-Simons theory with complex gauge group came to prominence in the late 80's, partly as a tool for understanding three-dimensional gravity with a negative cosmological constant \\cite{DIAT-CSgrav, DIWitten-gravCS, DIWitten-top, DIWitten-cx}. Many early developments were due to Witten. Since then, it has found a multitude of applications and deep connections with many parts of theoretical physics and mathematics.",
